# A class added by a turn that writes no state

## Component App
State:
    Let n be 0.
Actions:
    To add:
        Add class "act" to "#c".
    To bump:
        Set n to n + 1.
View:
    <p id="c">x</p><p id="n">{n}</p><button id="a" on-click={add}>a</button><button id="b" on-click={bump}>b</button>

## Test: a class added by a turn that moved nothing
    Mount App.
    Click "#a".
    Expect that the count of ".act" is equal to 1.
    Click "#b".
    Expect that the text of "#n" is equal to "1".
